dy Information<\/h3>\n\n<p><strong>Study Overview<\/strong>: In this study, you will make one main decision and then answer a series of survey questions across ${e:\/\/Field\/npage} pages. This study will take approximately ${e:\/\/Field\/time} minutes to complete. The use of AI tools or any form of automated assistance is strictly prohibited.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Payment<\/strong>: For completing this study, you are guaranteed a completion fee of $${e:\/\/Field\/showup}. In addition, you may earn a bonus payment.<\/p>\n\n<p>Specifically, one out of every 100 participants in this study will be randomly selected to have their decision as \"decision-maker\" implemented. If you are randomly selected to have your decision as the decision-maker implemented:<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>You will be randomly paired with another participant in the study (your \u201cpartner\u201d).<\/li>\n\t<li>The decision you make will determine the payments you and your partner are given as bonus payment.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<h3>Study Information<\/h3>\n\n<p><strong>Study Overview<\/strong>: To complete this study, you must first answer a series of questions that are split across ${e:\/\/Field\/nparts} parts. Then, you will complete a short follow-up questionnaire. This study will take you approximately ${e:\/\/Field\/time} minutes to complete.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Payment<\/strong>: For completing this study, you are guaranteed to receive $${e:\/\/Field\/showup} within 24 hours. In addition, one of the questions from Parts 1-${e:\/\/Field\/nparts} will be chosen as the question-that-counts. You will receive how much you earn in the question-that-counts as your bonus payment.&nbsp;<\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID13","SecondaryAttribute":"Comprehension check: Which of the following statements is true?\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrde