"32":{"Display":"Kentucky"},"33":{"Display":"Louisiana"},"34":{"Display":"Maine"},"35":{"Display":"Maryland"},"36":{"Display":"Massachusetts"},"37":{"Display":"Michigan"},"38":{"Display":"Minnesota"},"39":{"Display":"Mississippi"},"40":{"Display":"Missouri"},"41":{"Display":"Montana"},"42":{"Display":"Nebraska"},"43":{"Display":"New Hampshire"},"44":{"Display":"New Jersey"},"45":{"Display":"New Mexico"},"46":{"Display":"New York"},"47":{"Display":"North Carolina"},"48":{"Display":"North Dakota"},"49":{"Display":"Northern Mariana Islands"},"50":{"Display":"Ohio"},"51":{"Display":"Oklahoma"},"52":{"Display":"Oregon"},"53":{"Display":"Pennsylvania"},"54":{"Display":"Puerto Rico"},"55":{"Display":"Rhode Island"},"56":{"Display":"South Carolina"},"57":{"Display":"South Dakota"},"58":{"Display":"Tennessee"},"59":{"Display":"Texas"},"60":{"Display":"Utah"},"61":{"Display":"Vermont"},"62":{"Display":"Virginia"},"64":{"Display":"Alabama"},"66":{"Display":"Virgin Islands"},"67":{"Display":"Washington"},"68":{"Display":"West Virginia"},"69":{"Display":"Wisconsin"},"70":{"Display":"Wyoming"},"71":{"Display":"Other"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"state","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":72,"QuestionDescription":"Currently, in which US state or territory are you located?","QuestionID":"QID4","QuestionText":"<b>Currently, in which US state or territory are you located?<\/b>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>What is your state of residence in the US?<\/b>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"DL","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID40","SecondaryAttribute":"To complete this study, there are now 3 pages of additional questions. Your answers on these page...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>To complete this study, there are now <strong>3 pages<\/strong> of additional questions.<br><br><\/p>\n\t\n<p>Your answers on these pages will not influence your payment from this study in any way.<\/p>\n\n<p><br>Please answer all questions truthfully and carefully on these pages.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"transition","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"To complete this study, there are now 3 pages of additional questions. Your answers on these page...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID40"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID41","SecondaryAttribute":"Page 2 of ${e:\/\/Field\/npage}","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u><strong>Page 2 of ${e:\/\/Field\/npage}<\/strong><\/u>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"demographics","QuestionID":"QID41","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Page 2 of ${e:\/\/Field\/npage}","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID43","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"metadata","QuestionID":"QID43","QuestionType":"Meta","Selector":"Browser","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Browser","TextEntry":1},"2":{"Display":"Version","TextEntry":1},"3":{"Display":"Operating System","TextEntry":1},"4":{"Display":"Screen Resolution","TextEntry":1},"5":{"Display":"Flash Version","TextEntry":1},"6":{"Display":"Java Support","TextEntry":1},"7":{"Display":"User Agent","TextEntry":1}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID45","SecondaryAttribute":"What is the purpose of this research? This research is being conducted to learn more about how in...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"consent","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"What is the purpose of this research? This research is being conducted to learn more about how in...","QuestionID":"QID45","QuestionJS":false,"QuestionText":"<p><b><i>What is the purpose of this research?<\/i><\/b><\/p><p>This research is being conducted to learn more about how individuals answer survey questions and&nbsp;how individuals answer survey questions related to fairness.<br><br><b><i>What can I expect if I take part in this research?<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you take part in this study, you will be asked to answer several survey questions and then answer a short follow-up questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your participation will take approximately ${e:\/\/Field\/time} minutes to complete.<\/li>\n\t<li>This will be a one-time study conducted entirely on Prolific.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will be paid $${e:\/\/Field\/showup} for completing the survey.<br><br><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><b><i>What should I know about a research study? <\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Whether or not you take part is up to you.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your participation is completely voluntary.<\/li>\n\t<li>You can choose not to take part.<\/li>\n\t<li>You can agree to take part and later change your mind.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your decision will not be held against you.\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Your refusal to participate will not result in any consequences or any loss of benefits that you are otherwise entitled to receive.<\/li>\n\t\t<li>You can ask all the questions you want before you decide.<br><br><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><b><i>Who can I talk to?<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>If you have questions, concerns, or complaints, or think the research has hurt you, contact the research team via Prolific.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nBy participating in this research, you are indicating that you are at least 18 years old, have read this consent form, and agree to participate in this research study. Please keep this consent form for your records.<\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><b><i>What is the purpose of this research?<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>This research is being conducted to learn more about how individuals answer survey questions related to beliefs about various groups.<\/p>\n\n<p><b><i>What can I expect if I take part in this research?<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you take part in this study, you will be asked to answer several survey questions and then answer a short follow-up questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your participation will take approximately ${e:\/\/Field\/time} minutes to complete.<\/li>\n\t<li>This will be a one-time study conducted entirely on Prolific.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will be paid $${e:\/\/Field\/showup} for completing the survey.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><b><i>What should I know about a research study? <\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Whether or not you take part is up to you.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your participation is completely voluntary.<\/li>\n\t<li>You can choose not to take part.<\/li>\n\t<li>You can agree to take part and later change your mind.<\/li>\n\t<li>Your decision will not be held against you.\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Your refusal to participate will not result in any consequences or any loss of benefits that you are otherwise entitled to receive.<\/li>\n\t\t<li>You can ask all the questions you want before you decide.<\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><b><i>Who can I talk to?<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>If you have questions, concerns, or complaints, or think the research has hurt you, talk to the research team at exley@umich.edu.<\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID47","SecondaryAttribute":"Please copy and paste your Prolific ID here: Please note that this response should auto-fill with...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":580,"InputHeight":29},"DataExportTag":"prolific_id","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":{"TEXT":{"Text":"${e:\/\/Field\/PROLIFIC_PID}"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Please copy and paste your Prolific ID here: Please note that this response should auto-fill with...","QuestionID":"QID47","QuestionJS":false,"QuestionText":"<b>Please copy and paste your Prolific ID here:<\/b><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<em>Please note that this response should auto-fill with the correct ID<\/em>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Please copy and paste your Prolific ID here:<\/b><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<em>Please note that this response should auto-fill with the correct ID<\/em>","QuestionType":"TE","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"Selector":"SL","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"TotalChar","MinChars":"1","TotalChars":"24"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6WfjYkz92nsQWTI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID48","SecondaryAttribute":"MK: I like this one a lot. Having say 5 shapes\/images instead of 3 will dramatically reduce chanc...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b><i><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">MK: I like this one a lot. Having say 5 shapes\/images instead of 3 will dramatically reduce chance that the computer gets these right randomly, without increasing survey length too much.<br><br>Note: Below, having smaller images might make the ranking task more intuitive.<br><\/span>\n<br>\n\u2064\ufe0a\ufe0e\u2062\u2061\ufe00\ufe00\ufe06\ufe08\ufe0c\ufe0a\ufe02\ufeff\ufe0d\ufe06\ufe09\u200b\ufe01\ufe07\ufe05\u2061\u2061\ufe03\ufe07\ufe0e\u2064\u2062\ufe08\ufeff\u2064\ufe01\ufe09\ufe08\ufe0a\u2062\ufe02\ufe0e\ufe01\ufe01\u2062\ufe0c\ufe06\ufe0a\ufe0a\ufe08\ufe0e\ufe0c\u2064\u2061\ufe08\ufe00\u2061\ufe0a\ufe00\u2061\ufe08\ufe0e\ufe0d\u200b\ufe09\ufe0a\ufe02\ufe03\ufe02\ufe0d\ufe0d\ufe06\ufe04\ufe03\ufe02\ufe0e\ufe0c\ufe0d\ufe0e\ufe09\u2064\u2064\ufe0e\ufe0c\ufe02\ufe0e\ufe06\ufe06\u2063\ufe03\u200b\ufe08\ufe02\u200b\ufe09\ufe08\ufe09\u2064\u200b\u2064\ufe09\ufe09\ufe0e\u2061\u2061\ufe0a\u200b\ufe07\u200b\u200b\ufe04\ufe0e\u2063\u0420\ufe04\ufe02\ufe08\u2064\ufe02\ufe0c\u2061\u2061\u2063\ufe0c\u200b\ufe0b\ufe01\ufeff\ufe05\ufe0a\ufe06\ufe0b\ufe02\ufe0c\ufe0a\ufe05\ufe03\ufe0a\ufe0e\ufe05\u200b\ufe08\u2063\ufe05\ufe0d\u2062\ufe07\ufe0d\u200b\ufe01\ufe0d\ufe0c\ufe01\u2062\ufe06\u2062\ufe03\ufe0c\ufe06\ufe0d\ufe0a\u200b\ufe09\ufe03\ufe0a\ufeff\ufe0a\ufe01\ufe06\ufe0a\ufe00\ufe07\ufeff\ufe00\u2063\ufe0a\ufe04\u2063\ufe02\u2063\ufe09\ufe0e\ufe06\ufe0c\ufe03\ufe05\ufe0c\u2062\ufe0c\ufe07\ufe03\ufeff\u2064\ufe08\ufe0b\ufe02\ufe05\ufe08\ufe05\u200b\ufe0d\ufe01\ufe02\ufe0e\ufe0d\ufe03\ufe04\ufe0c\u2062\ufe03\ufe0d\ufe02l\ufe00\ufe02\ufe09\ufe0b\ufeff\u2064\ufe08\ufe00\u200b\ufe07\ufe07\ufe02\ufe03\ufe0e\ufe0d\ufe06\ufe01\ufe0e\ufeff\ufe0d\ufe04\ufe04\ufe07\ufe0e\ufe05\u2061\u2063\u2061\ufe00\ufe03\ufe06\ufeff\ufe0e\ufe0c\ufe0b\ufe0a\ufeff\u200b\ufe00\ufe03\u2063\u2062\ufe0b\ufe05\ufeff\ufe00\u2062\ufe0d\ufe0e\ufe09\ufe09\u2062\ufe06\ufe05\u2064\ufe00\u2063\u2063\u2064\ufe0b\ufe06\ufe09\u2062\ufe04\ufe0a\ufe06\ufe0d\ufe09\ufe02\u2063\ufe0a\ufe0d\u2064\u2061\ufe07\ufe09\ufe01\u2061\ufe0c\ufe01\u2062\ufe0a\u2062\ufe09\ufe05\ufe02\ufe00\u2062\ufe06\ufe05\ufe07\ufe00\ufe0a\ufe08\ufe00\ufe07\ufe0c\u2063\ufe04\ufe0c\ufe07\u2062\ufe00\ufe0b\u2064\u0435\u